      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the derogatory text",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'dirty immigrant scum' as the target of the hate speech. The text directly addresses and vilifies the group represented by the visual material, implying the user is identifying with or projecting their own prejudice onto the labeled group. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' in the text, but the hateful message is directed at the visual group, creating an implicit projection of the user's hostile attitude onto the family depicted.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_b007c1ce"
      },
